  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Given equation is:</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>We know,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>(</mo><mtext>using&#160;algebraic&#160;identities</mtext><mo>)</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></math></p><p>So, we can write the given equation as</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>)</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>or</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Case</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>Here</mtext><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mtext>&#160;i.e.&#160;no&#160;real&#160;solution</mtext><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Case</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>II</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mtext>Here</mtext><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>35</mn></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mtext>i.e.&#160;no&#160;real&#160;solution</mtext></math></p><p>Hence, we don&#39;t have real solutions.</p>"
  }
